        <b>Type:</b> Standing Stones <b>County/Region:</b> Languedoc:Aude (11) <br /> Pos Accuracy: <b>5</b> Condition: <b>Destroyed</b>  Ambience: <b>3</b>  Access: <b>4</b>  (5 is best)<br />
